# Production/preview Vite build overrides.
#
# This file is COMMITTED (un-ignored in .gitignore) on purpose: it carries only
# public, client-visible build-time URLs so git-integrated builds (Cloudflare
# Workers Builds) bake them without dashboard variables. Keep it VITE_-only —
# never put secrets here (secrets live in .prod.vars / the dashboard).
#
# Split deployment (see docs/DEPLOY_RENDER_CLOUDFLARE.md): the SPA is served by
# the Cloudflare Worker (`vibesdk-v2`) and calls the Go control plane on Render
# over HTTPS/WSS. Auth stays same-origin (the Worker serves /api/auth/*).
#
# The Worker origin must also be in the Go service's CORS allow-list
# (CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS on Render; the known workers.dev hosts are built in).
#
# If the Render service name is not `vibesdk-backend` (Render appends a suffix
# when the name is taken), update this URL AND `CONTROL_PLANE_URL` in
# wrangler.v2.jsonc to the real service URL.
VITE_CONTROL_PLANE_URL=https://vibesdk-backend.onrender.com
VITE_AUTH_PLANE_URL=https://vibesdk-v2.apjkala25.workers.dev
